    <statement><p>For the function <m>f(x)</m> shown in the graph below, sketch a graph of
the derivative.  You will then be picking which of the following is the
correct derivative graph, but should be sure to first sketch the
derivative yourself.</p>
<image xmlns:pi="http://pretextbook.org/2020/pretext/internal" pi:generated="webwork/images/Library__Michigan__Chap2Sec3__Q31_pg-image-1.png" width="41%">
<shortdescription>Graph of a function</shortdescription>
</image>
<p>Which of the following graphs is the derivative of <m>f(x)</m>?
